  "details": "It is incredibly frustrating when the game suddenly decides I need to log in again (which is an issue on it's own since logging in is incredibly tedious in VR) and I mistype the password multiple times not knowing what went wrong or if it even registered all of my presses. A simple \"view password\" in the password field would be nice so I can see what got typed in, it is literally a thing on every other game/site/service in existence.",
